of the growth hormone Cytokinin.


00:04:33.771 --> 00:04:36.843
So, yes, they will be ready
on time for the fair.


00:04:38.043 --> 00:04:39.679
What this plant really needs...


00:04:39.978 --> 00:04:41.713
