00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:58.117
No. Oh, shit.


00:06:59.016 --> 00:07:00.786
Oh, no!


00:07:04.021 --> 00:07:05.724
Stop laughing at me, Joe.


00:07:09.761 --> 00:07:11.760
