00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.088
Naturally.


00:08:09.887 --> 00:08:11.990
But sometimes, I simply
can't be there for him.


00:08:12.257 --> 00:08:14.126
Which does worry me.


00:08:15.026 --> 00:08:16.528
What worries you?


00:08:19.865 --> 00:08:22.264
